                                "example_id": "4b44fb7d-8420-4b92-9f10-ff08d309d72d",
                                "sense_id": "35511b78-76d5-3c9d-b30d-47caa178c995",
                                "text": "By the time she was twelve, she could flank and mug as well as her brothers, she could forefoot anything that moved, but it didn't matter."
